  "reasoning": "The defendant Zhao used false deposit certificates to deceive the bank and depositors, withdrew the deposited funds for personal use, and failed to return the money. The conduct meets the elements of fraud (诈骗罪): deception, illegal acquisition of property, and a particularly large amount. The prosecution argued against the charge of embezzlement because Zhao was not a bank employee, so the appropriate charge is fraud. No other crimes described (e.g., theft, drug possession, illegal blood sale) apply.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]诈骗<eoa>"
